1:# Pitfalls Research
7:## Critical Pitfalls
9:### Pitfall 1: Binance API rejects requests from Cloudflare's IPs (451 / geo-block)
34:### Pitfall 2: Cron Triggers don't run in Cloudflare Pages Functions
56:### Pitfall 3: D1 bound-parameter limit breaks naive batch inserts during backfill
